---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { u } from '../lib/paths';
---

<Base title="Faculty and staff" description="Calendar, account help, and research resources for University of Mars faculty and staff.">
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Faculty & staff"
    title="Faculty &amp; staff"
    lede="Grade rosters, the calendar, and account help live in the same places students use, with a few extra duties."
    crumbs={[{ href: '/faculty/', label: 'Faculty & staff' }]}
  >
    <p class="page-actions">
      <a class="btn" href={u('/support/?category=it#request')}>Get help with an account</a>
    </p>
  </PageHero>
  <article class="prose wrap narrow">
    <ul>
      <li>Fall grades were due Friday, December 18, 2026. They should already be submitted in MyUM.</li>
      <li>Spring Semester 2027 syllabi should be posted. Instruction began Monday, January 4.</li>
      <li>Final exam times are on the <a href={u('/academics/calendar/')}>academic calendar</a>. Do not move a final without the college’s approval.</li>
      <li>Staff research support and the observatory schedule are on the <a href={u('/research/')}>research page</a>.</li>
      <li>A duty to report sexual harassment or discrimination is described on the <a href={u('/title-ix/')}>Title IX page</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The library’s course-reserve desk needs reading lists three weeks before a term. Spring Semester 2027 lists were due in mid-December.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
